title: Microsoft Hyper-V: Host summary
agents: windows
catalog: os/virtual
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the name of a Microsoft Hyper-V host and the number of
 virtual machines registered on it.

 The check is always {OK}.

 The host gets the host label {cmk/hyperv_object:server}.

 The data is collected by the agent plug-in {hyperv_host.ps1}, which can be
 deployed with the agent bakery rule "Hyper-V".

discovery:
 One service is created if the agent reports the Hyper-V host.
